<title>USA: Realty Income names Lewis as CEO.</title>
<headline>Realty Income names Lewis as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ESCONDIDO, Calif 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Realty Income Corp said on Friday that Thomas Lewis was selected to succeed William Clark as chief executive officer of the company effective May 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Clark will continue as chairman of the Board of Directors. Lewis has been an officer of the company since 1987 and has served as the company's Vice Chairman since 1994.</p>
</text>
